rculars and ITAT Delhi precedents.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Documents compiled</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>ITAT precedents</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Written submissions</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="30" y1="28" x2="90" y2="28" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="30" y1="40" x2="85" y2="40" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3"/><line x1="30" y1="52" x2="75" y2="52" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Case Prepared</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">File Response via E-Proceedings</h3><p class="step-description">For faceless cases: upload through e-Proceedings with detailed cover letter. For non-faceless (search, TP): attend physical hearing at Delhi IT office with complete case file.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>E-Proceedings filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cover letter</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill=