                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Which Delhi IT office handles scrutiny assessments?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Under Faceless Assessment, most scrutiny is handled by NeAC through Assessment Units located anywhere in India. Delhi exceptions: search/seizure at ARA Centre Jhandewalan, international taxation/TP at Civic Centre Minto Road, specific charges at C.R. Building and Aayakar Bhawan. Non-faceless cases require physical hearing attendance.</p></div>
