                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes for faceless cases - through e-Proceedings on incometax.gov.in. Search/seizure (Central Charges) and international taxation cases still require physical hearings at Delhi IT offices. Patron handles both online responses and in-person representation at all Delhi offices.</p></div>
