                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is the penalty for not responding to scrutiny?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Rs 10,000 per failure under S.272A. AO can complete ex-parte assessment with maximum additions. Concealment penalty 100%-300% under S.271(1)(c). Misreporting penalty 200% under S.270A(8). Patron ensures timely responses to prevent these consequences.</p></div>
