                <p><strong>Scrutiny notice aaya hai, kya karein?</strong> Turant CA se contact karo. 143(2) notice ka matlab return selected hua hai check ke liye. Documents tayyar karo. Patron Delhi office se representation lo.</p>
<p><strong>Kya scrutiny ka matlab tax evade kiya hai?</strong> Nahi. Selection ka matlab sirf verify karna chahte hain. Sab sahi toh koi addition nahi.</p>
<p><strong>143(2) aur 143(3) mein fark?</strong> 143(2) notice hai (process shuru). 143(3) final order hai (process khatam).</p>

